    "summary.md": "# Roadmap\n\nTrack initiatives and their dependencies.\n\n- **Target user:** Product teams\n- **Build route:** hybrid\n- **Genome:** workflow\n- **Presentation:** board / pipeline\n- **Persistence:** browser-local storage\n- **Start:** `npm run dev` → http://localhost:3000\n\n## Planned verification journeys\n\n- Application loads and shows a useful empty state\n- Invalid initiative input shows validation without crashing\n- User can add a complete initiative and see it in initiatives\n- initiatives survive a page refresh\n- User can edit an existing initiative\n- User can search initiatives\n- User can narrow initiatives with a meaningful filter\n- initiatives are grouped by a meaningful category or status\n- Requested derived values update from persisted records\n- User can delete an existing initiative\n"
